        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000029 (Testicular atrophy)  ; abnormality of the genitourinary system</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Wasting (atrophy) of the testicle (the male gonad) manifested by a decrease in size and potentially by a loss of fertility.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>fr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
