        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000219 (Thin upper lip vermilion)  ; abnormality of head or neck</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Height of the vermilion of the upper lip in the midline more than 2 SD below the mean. Alternatively, an apparently reduced height of the vermilion of the upper lip in the frontal view (subjective).</babelon:source_value>
