        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormal configuration of the lower lip such that it is turned outward i.e., everted, with the Inner aspect of the lower lip vermilion (normally opposing the teeth) being visible in a frontal view.</babelon:source_value>
