        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Occipitofrontal (head) circumference greater than 97th centile compared to appropriate, age matched, sex-matched normal standards. Alternatively, a apparently increased size of the cranium.</babelon:source_value>
