        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000286 (Epicanthus)  ; abnormality of head or neck</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A fold of skin starting above the medial aspect of the upper eyelid and arching downward to cover, pass in front of and lateral to the medial canthus.</babelon:source_value>
