        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000378 (Cupped ear)  ; abnormality of the ear</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Laterally protruding ear that lacks antihelical folding (including absence of inferior and superior crura).</babelon:source_value>
