        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000524 (Conjunctival telangiectasia)  ; abnormality of the integument ; abnormality of head or neck ; abnormality of the cardiovascular system ; abnormality of the eye</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
