        <babelon:comment>definition of HP:0000601 (Hypotelorism)  ; abnormality of the eye</babelon:comment>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Interpupillary distance less than 2 SD below the mean (alternatively, the appearance of an decreased interpupillary distance or closely spaced eyes).</babelon:source_value>
